Module test.insurance.life.

# 合成示例策略——数值取自公开权威来源（2026-08 检索），非真实保险公司费率表。
#   · 基准费率：NerdWallet（费率由 LifeStein 提供，数据截至 2026-08-01）
#     $500k/20 年期/Preferred/男性非吸烟：20 岁 $210、30 岁 $213、40 岁 $321、
#     50 岁 $810、60 岁 $2331、70 岁 $9702（年保费）
#     ★保费随年龄非线性：20→30 仅 +1.4%，40→50 +152%，60→70 +316%
#   · 吸烟倍数 3.62x：由上表实算（60 岁 8435/2331）；ValuePenguin +215%、
#     U.S.News +146%、Policygenius +217%——行业区间 2.5-4.5x，无单一权威值
#   · BMI 分档：InsuranceGeek（Preferred Plus ≤25 / Preferred 26-28 /
#     Standard Plus 29-30 / Standard 31-35 / Table Rating 36-40 / >40-42 拒保）
#     ★该表为「典型 carrier 代表性限值」，未指名具体公司，各家 build chart 差异可达数十磅
#   · 分级费率差：LifeStein 实测 40 岁男 Preferred Plus $321 / Preferred $405 / Standard $631
#   · 职业倍数：BLS《2024 年致命职业伤害普查》（2026-02-19 发布）
#     全国基准 3.3/10万 FTE；伐木 110.4(33.5x)、渔猎 88.8(26.9x)、屋顶 48.7(14.8x)、
#     飞行员 36.7(11.1x)、卡车司机 25.7(7.8x，绝对死亡数 950 全美最高)、建筑 15.8(4.8x)
#     ★真实核保用 flat extra（每千保额加 $2.50-5.00）而非乘数，此处简化为乘数
#   · 最高投保年龄 75：★无行业统一上限，按产品条款而定，此为示例产品设定

Define Applicant has applicantId, age, gender, smoker, bmi, occupation, healthScore.

Define PolicyRequest has coverageAmount, termYears, policyType.

Define LifeQuote has approved, reason, monthlyPremium, coverageAmount, termYears.

Rule calculateBaseRate given age, termYears, produce:
  Let rate be 210.
  If age at least 30
    Let rate be 213.
  If age at least 40
    Let rate be 321.
  If age at least 50
    Let rate be 810.
  If age at least 60
    Let rate be 2331.
  If age at least 70
    Let rate be 9702.
  If termYears at most 10
    Return (rate times 62) integer divided by 100.
  If termYears at most 15
    Return (rate times 80) integer divided by 100.
  If termYears at most 20
    Return rate.
  Return (rate times 138) integer divided by 100.
Rule calculateHealthMultiplier given applicant, produce:
  Let multiplier be 100.
  If applicant.bmi at least 29
    Let multiplier be 121.
  If applicant.bmi at least 31
    Let multiplier be 177.
  If applicant.bmi at least 36
    Let multiplier be 250.
  If applicant.healthScore at least 90
    If applicant.bmi less than 29
      Let multiplier be 88.
  If applicant.smoker equals to true
    Return (multiplier times 362) integer divided by 100.
  Return multiplier.
Rule calculateOccupationMultiplier given occupation, produce:
  If occupation equals to "logging"
    Return 3350.
  If occupation equals to "fishing"
    Return 2690.
  If occupation equals to "roofing"
    Return 1480.
  If occupation equals to "pilot"
    Return 1110.
  If occupation equals to "truck-driver"
    Return 780.
  If occupation equals to "construction"
    Return 480.
  If occupation equals to "office"
    Return 100.
  Return 100.
Rule calculateRiskScore given applicant, produce:
  Let score be 100.
  If applicant.smoker equals to true
    Let score be score minus 30.
  If applicant.bmi at least 31
    Let score be score minus 20.
  If applicant.bmi at least 36
    Let score be score minus 15.
  If applicant.healthScore at least 90
    Let score be score plus 10.
  If applicant.age at least 60
    Let score be score minus 15.
  Return score.
Rule generateLifeQuote given applicant, request, produce:
  If applicant.age less than 18
    Return LifeQuote with approved set to false, reason set to "Applicant below minimum issue age", monthlyPremium set to 0, coverageAmount set to 0, termYears set to 0.
  If applicant.age at least 76
    Return LifeQuote with approved set to false, reason set to "Applicant above maximum issue age", monthlyPremium set to 0, coverageAmount set to 0, termYears set to 0.
  If applicant.healthScore less than 40
    Return LifeQuote with approved set to false, reason set to "Health score below underwriting threshold", monthlyPremium set to 0, coverageAmount set to 0, termYears set to 0.
  If applicant.bmi at least 41
    Return LifeQuote with approved set to false, reason set to "Build outside underwriting limits", monthlyPremium set to 0, coverageAmount set to 0, termYears set to 0.
  If request.coverageAmount at least 5000001
    Return LifeQuote with approved set to false, reason set to "Coverage exceeds maximum", monthlyPremium set to 0, coverageAmount set to 0, termYears set to 0.
  Let baseRate be calculateBaseRate(applicant.age, request.termYears).
  Let healthMult be calculateHealthMultiplier(applicant).
  Let occMult be calculateOccupationMultiplier(applicant.occupation).
  Let scaled be (baseRate times request.coverageAmount) integer divided by 500000.
  Let withHealth be (scaled times healthMult) integer divided by 100.
  Let annual be (withHealth times occMult) integer divided by 100.
  Let monthly be annual integer divided by 12.
  Return LifeQuote with approved set to true, reason set to "Approved", monthlyPremium set to monthly, coverageAmount set to request.coverageAmount, termYears set to request.termYears.
Rule testApplicantTooYoung, produce:
  Let applicant be Applicant with applicantId set to "L1", age set to 17, gender set to "M", smoker set to false, bmi set to 22, occupation set to "office", healthScore set to 90.
  Let request be PolicyRequest with coverageAmount set to 500000, termYears set to 20, policyType set to "term".
  Let quote be generateLifeQuote(applicant, request).
  Return quote.reason.
Rule testApplicantTooOld, produce:
  Let applicant be Applicant with applicantId set to "L2", age set to 80, gender set to "M", smoker set to false, bmi set to 24, occupation set to "office", healthScore set to 80.
  Let request be PolicyRequest with coverageAmount set to 500000, termYears set to 20, policyType set to "term".
  Let quote be generateLifeQuote(applicant, request).
