Rule testCoverageExceedsMaximum, produce:
  Let applicant be Applicant with applicantId set to "L4", age set to 40, gender set to "M", smoker set to false, bmi set to 24, occupation set to "office", healthScore set to 85.
  Let request be PolicyRequest with coverageAmount set to 6000000, termYears set to 20, policyType set to "term".
